{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >It finally happened, the Zombocalypse has Zom-begun and now it's up to you to help protect the last survivors from the horde.\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Demo Approximately 30 minutes</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombocalypse Now! is a simplified base-builder RTS, during the day find the right balance between  generating resources and building defences to protect your settlement. At night direct your survivors in taking on the horde. Do you rely on walls and turrets to keep you safe or build an army of eager survivors and go toe to toe with the enemy? One wrong decision could mean the end of civilisation as we know it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993590/extras/cfe1c372202fefd1006a15fb94866d25.poster.avif?t=1757541924\" width=600 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993590/extras/cfe1c372202fefd1006a15fb94866d25.webm?t=1757541924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993590/extras/cfe1c372202fefd1006a15fb94866d25.mp4?t=1757541924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to new challenges by freely swapping between different survivor classes and face off against the unforgiving abominations. Survive long enough to max out your settlement and escape!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993590/extras/537e23b626aa4c8ba6e43943071209a0.poster.avif?t=1757541924\" width=600 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993590/extras/537e23b626aa4c8ba6e43943071209a0.webm?t=1757541924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993590/extras/537e23b626aa4c8ba6e43943071209a0.mp4?t=1757541924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of leader with 3 unique roles: The Commander, Merchant, and Tinkerer. Each with their own abilities and playstyles to shape the economy and the battlefield. Complete each apocalyptic map to unlock Last Bastion, an endless wave game mode to test your endurance.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3993590?t=1757541924","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993590/4f4fcfbd68e26558fd694f700abdb5df89cf6be4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757541924","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993590/00579e0d9a7078afb80f0d8b8b0827eb17f260f7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757541924","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993590/00579e0d9a7078afb80f0d8b8b0827eb17f260f7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757541924","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3993600,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >It finally happened, the Zombocalypse has Zom-begun and now it's up to you to help protect the last survivors from the horde.\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Demo Approximately 30 minutes</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombocalypse Now! is a simplified base-builder RTS, during the day find the right balance between  generating resources and building defences to protect your settlement. At night direct your survivors in taking on the horde. Do you rely on walls and turrets to keep you safe or build an army of eager survivors and go toe to toe with the enemy? One wrong decision could mean the end of civilisation as we know it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993590/extras/cfe1c372202fefd1006a15fb94866d25.poster.avif?t=1757541924\" width=600 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993590/extras/cfe1c372202fefd1006a15fb94866d25.webm?t=1757541924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993590/extras/cfe1c372202fefd1006a15fb94866d25.mp4?t=1757541924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to new challenges by freely swapping between different survivor classes and face off against the unforgiving abominations. Survive long enough to max out your settlement and escape!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993590/extras/537e23b626aa4c8ba6e43943071209a0.poster.avif?t=1757541924\" width=600 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993590/extras/537e23b626aa4c8ba6e43943071209a0.webm?t=1757541924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993590/extras/537e23b626aa4c8ba6e43943071209a0.mp4?t=1757541924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of leader with 3 unique roles: The Commander, Merchant, and Tinkerer. Each with their own abilities and playstyles to shape the economy and the battlefield. Complete each apocalyptic map to unlock Last Bastion, an endless wave game mode to test your endurance.</p>","developers":["Pixel Drip Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993590/bf4a7c762fd2c373605352c090c50cb90b39b0b6/header.jpg?t=1757541924","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3993590/695734977/a71a43cd6178cff9c5e9bad8149e151e39616c32/1756680161/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757541923","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3993590/695734977/a71a43cd6178cff9c5e9bad8149e151e39616c32/1756680161/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757541923","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3993590/695734977/a71a43cd6178cff9c5e9bad8149e151e39616c32/1756680161/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1757541923","id":257189996,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257189996/movie480.mp4?t=1757541923","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257189996/movie_max.mp4?t=1757541923"},"name":"Zombocalypse Now! Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257189996/e4afb32f7b7e00a80bf91007c9abe456b2f5532c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757541923","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257189996/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1757541923","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257189996/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=175754